          "section": "Articulate Your Learning Objectives — alignment, measurable objectives, and assessment",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-10-13T13:25:51Z",
          "textSha256": "dfbb33d7a75a83ce7b896245c1805bb4f9cda084386a091699ff2e886b566fcd"
        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Before increment authoring, define the existing project package/overlay slot and a machine-readable manifest for FT1-FT4, FT6 and FT8 that references the unchanged calendar rows, orders extensions, names public tests, records claimed/practised fragments and preserves each 70-minute block. This is delivery metadata, not a new syllabus topic or coding lab.",
