        "line": 24
      },
      "claim": "Objective o1 expands the frozen Reading topic 'common API security risks (OWASP)' into recall of the complete OWASP API Security Top 10 2023 list. Requiring learners to name all ten categories is broader than the source wording, competes with the more applicable classification and ownership-check objectives, and is especially disproportionate for a 9-minute page that Fast treats as skim/reference.",
      "evidence": [
        {
