          "textSha256": "ac00589e1bb28f4977b3c82dfb61713b7aac0cbd07b15bd40d8516ef86379524"
        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Do not add or rename a syllabus topic. Narrow o1 to identify or match a small, explicitly selected set of common risks relevant to this course's API, then keep o2/o3 focused on diagnosing and mitigating those risks. The full Top 10 can remain optional reference material rather than a recall objective.",
